          <a:p>
            <a:r>
              <a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1650" b="1"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="F43F5E"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Segoe UI Semibold"/></a:rPr>
              <a:t>Limitations of Traditional Online Learning</a:t>
            </a:r>
          </a:p>
          <a:p><a:endParaRPr sz="600"/></a:p>
          <a:p>
              <a:pPr marL="280000" indent="-280000"><a:buFont typeface="Arial"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr>
              <a:r>
                <a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1350"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="E2E8F0"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Segoe UI"/></a:rPr>
                <a:t>Severe Bandwidth Demands: Video conferencing (Zoom/Meet) requires 2-4 Mbps, causing severe buffering and dropouts in rural areas.</a:t>
              </a:r>
            </a:p><a:p>
              <a:pPr marL="280000" indent="-280000"><a:buFont typeface="Arial"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr>
              <a:r>
                <a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1350"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="E2E8F0"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Segoe UI"/></a:rPr>
                <a:t>High Production Overhead: High-quality educational videos require expensive studio equipment, recording setups, and extensive editing.</a:t>
              </a:r>
            </a:p><a:p>
              <a:pPr marL="280000" indent="-280000"><a:buFont typeface="Arial"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr>
              <a:r>
                <a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1350"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="E2E8F0"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Segoe UI"/></a:rPr>
                <a:t>Static, Outdated Curricula: Updating syllabus content requires re-recording entire video series from scratch.</a:t>
              </a:r>
            </a:p><a:p>
              <a:pPr marL="280000" indent="-280000"><a:buFont typeface="Arial"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr>
              <a:r>
                <a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1350"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="E2E8F0"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Segoe UI"/></a:rPr>
                <a:t>Passive Disengagement: Pre-recorded MOOCs suffer from low student engagement and completion rates below 10%.</a:t>
              </a:r>
            </a:p>
        </p:txBody>
      </p:sp>

