                <a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1350"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="E2E8F0"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Segoe UI"/></a:rPr>
                <a:t>Hallucination Risks: Generic public LLMs hallucinate inaccurate concepts rather than adhering strictly to accredited university textbooks.</a:t>
              </a:r>
            </a:p>
        </p:txBody>
